        "main_content": [
          {
            "tag": "h1",
            "text": "Structure is power."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Clear, consistent documentation is a growth lever. Organized at scale, it keeps every team aligned, every customer up to speed, and turns business-critical content into a strategic advantage"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Reduce time to market with smart content reuse"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Paligo provides topic-based authoring and smart content reuse in a component content management system that enables you to release your documentation in a fraction of the time."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "What used to take the better part of a week for 3 versions of our documents, we are now creating 12 versions in under an hour."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Goodbye content silos. Hello team collaboration."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Have your entire team working together on your content. No more shuffling files back and forth. With a cloud-based component content management system, everyone is on the same page."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Content reuse + AI a perfect match"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Paligo structured authoring and content reuse is a perfect match for AI-powered capabilities. For one thing, structured authoring with rich metadata ensures creation of the best content for AI consumption . At the same time, smart AI features in Paligo can help making content production faster and more efficient. Finally, the content reuse features ensures that you don&#8217;t create content unnecessarily, avoiding time-consuming work and review efforts."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Write once Publish everywhere"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Personalize your content for different audiences and publish it anywhere your customers need it. With powerful multi-channel publishing, Paligo allows you to write your content once, and repurpose it at the click of a button to any output format and channel you need."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Tame the content chaos"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Experience full control at your fingertips with a Component Content Management System that truly puts you in the driver’s seat. Organize and categorize content with taxonomies and know exactly where content is reused down to the smallest text fragment."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "It's currently the best web-based CCMS out there."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Future-proof your valuable content"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Structured Authoring makes your content accurate, consistent, up-to-date, and future-proof. Treat your organization’s valuable content right."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "I find myself enjoying the abilities it gives me to really structure my content in a way that users can consume more easily."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Fast Return on Investment"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Quickly get an idea of your own return on investment with the ROI calculator, based on industry research data. Book a meeting with sales and get access."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Up to"
          },
          {
