          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "See why customers love Paligo"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Don’t just take our word for it. Find out why Paligo is top-rated on G2 and TrustRadius in the Component Content Management System category."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Book a demo"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Sign up here and we’ll get right back to you! Or use our meeting booking function right after you have submitted the form."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "If we see that Paligo would be a good fit for you after a demo there’s also a chance to have a free trial to test it out further."
